## 🔄 After changing the roster
Adding/removing a role means: update this table **and** the `.claude/agents/` file
**and** `STRUCTURE.json`, then ask the user to reload so the runtime hot-loads it.
Partners live in `STRUCTURE.json`'s `partners` array; shared CLI/function usage in
its `cli.consumers` reverse index. `{{core}} doctor` fails if any of these drift apart.
